 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Ah, an proud moment. What kind of art does she do? Sure. Painting, drawing, photography, and digital art are easy to discuss. What about sculpture, art history, or sound art? Not knowing is fine. Ask her to describe each piece, maybe even ask her why she chose each one. That's okay. Balance the obvious with something unexpected. A photo of an empty room can say a lot when the title is what I see next. Take your time. A strong portfolio shows what you can achieve, but an interesting one shows who you are.",
